message: >-
  If you use this software in teaching material, a publication or a
  product, please cite it as below.
title: "anywidget instruments: instrument panels for notebooks, dashboards and the web"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Celles
    given-names: Sébastien
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9987-4338"
    affiliation: "Université de Poitiers"
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/AnywidgetInstruments/.github"
url: "https://anywidgetinstruments.github.io/"
abstract: >-
  A family of instrument widgets for notebooks, dashboards and the web,
  built on anywidget: a core, industrial, automotive and aeronautics
  widget libraries, and hosts for Python, Julia and Grafana. For
  visualization, teaching, simulation and supervision.
keywords:
  - instrumentation
  - widgets
  - notebooks
  - dashboards
  - anywidget
  - education
